sequenceDiagram
    actor Emp as Empleado (App Móvil)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Ctrl as ClockInController<br/>(Adapter)
    participant UC as ClockInUseCase<br/>(Application)
    participant GeoPort as GeoFenceValidator<br/>(Port)
    participant RepoPort as TimeEntryRepository<br/>(Port)
    participant Cache as Redis
    participant Kafka as Kafka Broker
    participant Consumer as TimeEntryConsumer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Emp->>GW: POST /clock-in {coords, employeeId}
    GW->>GW: Validar JWT / Rate limit
    GW->>Ctrl: Forward request
    Ctrl->>Ctrl: Mapear DTO -> ClockInInput
    Ctrl->>UC: execute(ClockInInput)

    UC->>GeoPort: isWithinGeoFence(coords)
    GeoPort->>Cache: obtener geofence activa (cache)
    Cache-->>GeoPort: GeoFence data
    GeoPort-->>UC: true / false

    alt fuera de geofence
        UC-->>Ctrl: Error: OutOfGeoFenceException
        Ctrl-->>Emp: 422 Ubicación inválida
    else dentro de geofence
        UC->>UC: crear entidad TimeEntry (PENDING)
        UC->>RepoPort: save(TimeEntry) [async/optimista]
        RepoPort->>Kafka: publish(TimeEntryCreated)
        Kafka-->>RepoPort: ack
        RepoPort-->>UC: eventId
        UC-->>Ctrl: ClockInOutput{status: RECEIVED}
        Ctrl-->>Emp: 202 Accepted {eventId}

        Kafka->>Consumer: consume(TimeEntryCreated)
        Consumer->>Consumer: validar idempotencia (eventId)
        Consumer->>DB: INSERT time_entry
        DB-->>Consumer: OK
        Consumer->>Cache: invalidar cache de timesheet
    end
